  message: "Fixed in PR #3353 (commit 259b379ba). Added _emit_module_level_assign_symbols helper that walks tree.body and emits Symbol(kind='variable', ...) for top-level Assign and AnnAssign with Name targets, including tuple unpacking. Also made the cli.py noise-filter language-conditional for 'variable' kind ({css, scss, sass, less} stays excluded; Python/Go/YAML/Make stay in output). Tagged awaits_bakeoff_validation — claim is 'ALL-CAPS python externals drop from ~150 to near-zero on hypergumbo self-analysis.'"  # f5ab
