  message: "awaits_bakeoff_validation tag stripped via hand-correction of inconclusive plurality verdict from cohort cohort-001/iter-001 (deep-20260425-210357). Per-repo verdicts: airflow=moved (15,095 Python kind=variable nodes; 9,794 ALL_CAPS — module-level NAME = ... constants now indexed, far above the 'drop from ~150 ALL-CAPS externals to near-zero' threshold the claim predicted). kafka=moved (297 Python kind=variable nodes; 218 ALL_CAPS — works on Python-as-dev-tooling too). Other 3 repos verdict=inconclusive (no Python content). Plurality returned inconclusive because most repos cannot test a Python-only claim; the 2 repos that could both report moved. Hand-stripping per the operator decision."  # 7c9a
